{"source": "halo-crm", "widget_system": {"definition": "Typed WidgetDef per card (src/widgets/engine/WidgetDef.ts): id (persistence key), label, shortLabel, hint, defaultOn, span (3-12 cols), fill (fluid|fixed|atomic|natural|fit), kind (band|chart|table|panel), component or renderer type, source key(s), sizes list, locked, about (mine|team), dashboard slot, door path, minWidth, options, icon. Each page has one file defining its widgets; a registry derives the dashboard from marked widgets.", "kinds": ["band: figures, no expand", "chart: drawing, expands to room", "table: sheet of rows, expands to data", "panel: composed surface, expands to door", "renderers: pills, story, figure, chart, periods, breakdown, funnel, leaderboard, list, feed, progress, heat-map, calendar, weekday, heat, entities, help, pages, read"], "sizes": "columns of 12: S=3, S-wide=4, M=6, L=8, XL or band=12; per-widget allowed list from preset sets (read, story, chart, periods, donut, funnel, board, list, feed, heat, weekday, entities, figure, progress, help, pages). Content changes with size; never scales. minWidth default px: table 520, chart 320, panel 300.", "layout": "12-column CSS grid, measured width; packLayout keeps designer pairings (8+4) and widens cards below minWidth from row-mates. Drag handle reorders by cell under pointer; keyboard arrows move a card; handle menu gives size, move, fold, hide. Add slot fills the last row's gap. Stored per page per person in localStorage (halo.widgets.<page>.v1) and mirrored to the server row for that person; reset deletes the row; stored choice merges over defaults, so new widgets appear at their default.", "states": "loading: skeleton at the size's body height; empty: one line from a copy map, with an action when a real destination exists; error: reference and Retry for that widget's query only; crash: per-widget boundary with Retry; locked band always on; viewer-unavailable widgets greyed with the reason.", "variants": "fill modes control how a card meets its row; about=team puts team cards first; gallery shows live thumbnails of the real card; design v3 opt-in flag; dashboard slot sets span per page; about 118 widget defs across 24 page files; 18 data source adapters; 49 widget component files"}}
